# Loopful Rules

When the `/loopful` skill is invoked:

- Follow the active workflow stages defined in the skill.
- Do not make irreversible changes without explicit approval.
- Use existing project conventions and tooling.
- Verify before claiming completion — run existing tests first.
- Prefer minimal changes over large rewrites.
- Save all reports under `.loopful/reports/`.
- Respect the user's preferences in `.loopful/preferences.md`.
- Do not skip the clarification gate when requirements are ambiguous.
- Update `.loopful/state.json` at each stage transition.
